-- expect-refusal: the stock evaluator cannot seal its aggregate
-- examples/checks/agg-count-strata-3-refused-untabled.rofl — under the
-- stock evaluator with no stratum table, a count over a relation that a
-- negation derives. The negation and the count would share the final pass,
-- and the count would be sealed over whatever that pass had derived so far
-- (it read 0 here, where the answer is 4), so the program is refused.
edb(acu_r).
edb(acu_bad).
acu_r(g1, 1).
acu_r(g1, 2).
acu_r(g2, 3).
acu_r(g2, 4).
acu_bad(9).
acu_ok(G, X) :- acu_r(G, X), not acu_bad(X).
acu_all(C)   :- C is count(G, X : acu_ok(G, X)).
